From: Viljo Marrandi <30616+vilts@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 23:03:55 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] refactor(tools): ship the starter tool catalog as
 assets/tools/catalog.json

The 28 starter tools move from a Rust table to a camcraft-tools/1 JSON
asset embedded with include_str!; catalog() keeps its contract. The tools
crate reads it with a small strict reader (named errors, never a panic);
a test in app pins that parse_tool_library reads the same file identically.
The JSON was checked equal to the old table tool for tool before the table
was deleted.

Fixes #741

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
